\f12\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {Assess your computer systems
\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \fi-180\li1080\ri360\sl-360\slmult0\widctlpar\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\faauto\adjustright\rin360\lin1080\itap0 
\f12\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\par \bullet \tab Do you know exactly who has access? Can you print a report?
\par \bullet \tab Does everybody have his or her own unique user ID? Are passwords secret?
\par \bullet \tab Are you using technical features to require a password minimum length of at least six characters? Are you using technical features to avoid easily guessed passwords?
\par \bullet \tab Do all staff have access to all data systems? Or could you reduce some people\rquote s access?
\par \bullet \tab Is there an inactivity timeout feature? If so, is it set to a reasonable time period?
\par \bullet \tab Is there an audit trail of data changes? Of all accesses? Are you reviewing it?
\par \bullet \tab Is the data backed up? By whom? How often? Kept where?
\par \bullet \tab Is there a plan for handling patients if/when the system\rquote s down? Has it been tested?
\par \bullet \tab Does your vendor have remote access? How is it secured? Is there a business associate contract with security provisions?
\par \bullet \tab Is your system connected to the Internet? If so, is there a firewall? Are you controlling \line outbound traffic to ensure that encryption is used when appropriate?
