\f12\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {Assess your workforce practices
\par }\pard\plain \s15\ql \fi-180\li1080\ri360\sl-360\slmult0\widctlpar\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\tx9360\tx10080\faauto\adjustright\rin360\lin1080\itap0 
\f12\fs22\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\par \bullet \tab Do staff cover up patient records, turn them over, or otherwise keep them out of sight \line of the public? 
\par \bullet \tab Are records locked up when unattended and at the end of the day? If not, are they \line reasonably covered and protected?
\par \bullet \tab Are cleaning and maintenance personnel supervised when in the medical-records \line fileroom or wherever patient records are?
\par \bullet \tab Do staff discuss patients only when appropriate for patient management (treatment, \line payment, etc.)?
\par \bullet \tab Do staff keep their voices lowered when discussing patients, whether with the patient, among themselves, on the phone, etc.?
\par \bullet \tab Are computer screens turned away from/not visible to the public?
\par \bullet \tab Do staff always log on using their own user ID?
\par \bullet \tab Do staff keep their passwords secret, don\rquote t share, don\rquote t write on stickies, etc.?
\par \bullet \tab Do staff always log off computers when leaving?
\par \bullet \tab Are all papers with any patient-identifiable information shredded?
\par \bullet \tab Are diskettes, CDs, or other media with patient data properly stored? Sent out? Destroyed?
\par \bullet \tab Is access to the facility controlled? Who has keys?
\par \bullet \tab Are doors locked when the office is unattended?
\par \bullet \tab If portable computers such as laptops and personal digital assistants are used for any \line protected health information, are they kept locked when not in use?
